    "domain": "Natural Sciences",
    "framing": "How did physicists establish whether the anomalous precession of Mercury's perihelion arose from an undiscovered planet or from a deficiency in Newtonian gravitation itself?",
    "split": "test",
    "word_count": 466,
    "generator": "claude-opus-5",
